例》及本市相关规定，制定本政策。</div>     </div>          <!-- 细则 -->     <div>         <div style=\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">             细则         </div>         <div style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;\">             <div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">1、职工达到法定退休年龄的，可申请提取住房公积金；</div>             <div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">2、提取金额为账户全部余额；</div>             <div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">3、需提供退休证明等相关材料；</div>             <div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">4、提取后账户注销;</div>         </div>     </div> </div>","columns":"4","api_url":"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service","api_method":"post","api_data":"{     \"cxlx\": \"{\\\"metricsKey\\\":\\\"zcyc_ltxtq\\\"}\",     \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\" }","form_title":"调整政策参数","policy_groups":"[     {         \"title\": \"离退休提取参数\",         \"columns\": 4,         \"fields\": [             {                 \"name\": \"ltxtq_txnl_1\",                 \"label\": \"退休年龄要求(男)\",                 \"type\": \"input-number\",                 \"value\": 60             },             {                 \"name\": \"ltxtq_txnl_2\",                 \"label\": \"退休年龄要求(女)\",                 \"type\": \"input-number\",                 \"value\": 55             },             {                 \"name\": \"ltxtq_tqtx_gl\",                 \"label\": \"提前退休工龄要求\",                 \"type\": \"input-number\",                 \"value\": 30             },             {                 \"name\": \"ltxtq_sfxyzm\",                 \"label\": \"是否要求退休证明\",                 \"type\": \"select\",                 \"options\": [                     {                         \"label\": \"是\",                         \"value\": \"是\"                     },                     {                         \"label\": \"否\",                         \"value\": \"否\"                     }                 ],                 \"value\": \"是\"             }         ]     } ]","policy_action