gin-bottom: 4px;\">2、提取额度不超过当期应还贷款本息，且不超过账户余额；</div>             <div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">3、每年可提取一次；</div>             <div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">4、需提供贷款合同和还款明细；</div>         </div>     </div> </div>","columns":"4","api_url":"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service","api_method":"post","api_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"{\\n  \\\"metricsKey\\\": \\\"zcyc_chdktq\\\"\\n}\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n}","form_title":"调整政策参数","policy_groups":"[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"偿还购房贷款本息提取参数\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"chdktq_maxtqje\",\n        \"label\": \"月还贷提取上限(元)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 8000\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"chdktq_maxtqcs\",\n        \"label\": \"年度提取次数上限\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 12\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"chdktq_dklx\",\n        \"label\": \"贷款类型限制\",\n        \"type\": \"select\",\n        \"options\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"商业贷款\",\n            \"value\": \"商业贷款\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"公积金贷款\",\n            \"value\": \"公积金贷款\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"商业贷款/公积金贷款\",\n            \"value\": \"商业贷款/公积金贷款\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"商业贷款/公积金贷款\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"chdktq_sftgmx\",\n        \"label\": \"是否要求还款明细\",\n        \"type\": \"select\",\n        \"options\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"是\",\n            \"value\": \"是\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"否\",\n            \"value\": \"否\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"是\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]","policy_actions":"[\n  {\n    \"label\": \"📊 智能分析\",\n    \"actionType\": \"ai_analysis\",\n    \"level\": \"danger\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"label\": \"🔄 重置\",\n    \"actionType\": \"reset\",\n    \"level\": \"default\",\n    \"style\": {\n      \"marginLeft\": \"10px\"\n    }\n  }\n]","page_key":"chdktq","enable_query_input":true}');
