程开工后一年内申请提取；</div>             <div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">4、需提供相关批准文件和施工合同;</div>         </div>     </div> </div>","columns":"4","api_url":"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service","api_method":"post","api_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"{\\n  \\\"metricsKey\\\": \\\"zcyc_fjdxtq\\\"\\n}\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n}","form_title":"调整政策参数","policy_groups":"[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"建造、翻建、大修提取参数\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"fjdxtq_maxtqje\",\n        \"label\": \"工程总价提取上限(万元)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 50\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"fjdxtq_wcjd\",\n        \"label\": \"工程完成进度要求(%)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 50\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"fjdxtq_sqsx\",\n        \"label\": \"申请时限(月)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 12\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"fjdxtq_sfys\",\n        \"label\": \"是否要求工程验收\",\n        \"type\": \"select\",\n        \"options\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"是\",\n            \"value\": \"是\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"否\",\n            \"value\": \"否\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"是\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]","policy_actions":"[\n  {\n    \"label\": \"📊 智能分析\",\n    \"actionType\": \"ai_analysis\",\n    \"level\": \"danger\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"label\": \"🔄 重置\",\n    \"actionType\": \"reset\",\n    \"level\": \"default\",\n    \"style\": {\n      \"marginLeft\": \"10px\"\n    }\n  }\n]","page_key":"fjdxtq","enable_query_input":true}');
