.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;''> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t2、免罚息期限政策：设定免罚息天数为10天，免罚息天数内还款不计罚息； \\t\\t\\t\\t</div> \\t\\t\\t\\t<div style=''color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;''> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t3、催收管理政策：逾期1-30天短信提醒，逾期31-60天电话提醒，61-150天上门催收，150-180天发送律师函，180天以上启动法律程序； \\t\\t\\t\\t</div> \\t\\t\\t\\t<div style=''color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;''> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t4、展期政策：因特殊原因（如失业、疾病等）导致暂时还款困难的借款人，可申请贷款展期，展期后家庭月收入不低于月还款额的2倍。 \\t\\t\\t\\t</div> \\t\\t\\t</div> \\t\\t</div> \\t</div> </div></div>"\u000a}\u000a,\u000a\u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "container",\u000a            "className": "m-t-md",\u000a            "style": {\u000a                "backgroundColor": "#fff",\u000a                "borderRadius": "10px",\u000a                "boxShadow": "0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)",\u000a                "padding": "25px",\u000a                "marginBottom": "20px"\u000a            },\u000a            "body": [\u000a                \u000a                \u000a    {\u000a      "type": "service",\u000a      \u000a      "api": {\u000a        "method": "post",\u000a        "url": "/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service"\u000a        \u000a        ,"data": {"cxlx":"{\\n  \\"metricsKey\\": \\"zcyc_dkyql_value\\"\\n}","jgbh":"1305282025"}\u000a        \u000a        \u000a      },\u000a      \u000a      "body": [\u000a        \u000a        \u000a\u000a        \u000a        \u000a        \u000a        {\u000a          "type": "each",\u000a          "name": "${groups || [{ items: [], title: '''', columns: 5, border_color: '''' }]}",\u000a          "items": {\u000a            "type": "container",\u000a            "className": "m-b-md",\u000a            "body": [\u000a              {\u000a                "type": 