 style=''color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 1px; text-indent: 0px; text-align: justify;''><strong>1. 已逾期风险分析：</strong>针对已经发生逾期行为的借款人进行分析，根据逾期原因、逾期天数、逾期金额、借款人管理部、逾期五级分类、借款人单位等指标，评估逾期贷款的现状与处置优先级。</div><div style=''color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 1px; text-indent: 0px; text-align: justify;''><strong>2. 逾期预测：</strong>针对当前正常还款但存在潜在风险的借款人进行预测分析，基于历史逾期记录、大病医疗提取、贷后缴存异常、征信报告异常、信用评分、单位缴存状况等指标，识别未来可能发生逾期的风险。</div></div></div></div></div>","page_key":"dhhkfx","id":710,"version":40,"mode":"update","query_label":"若对大模型分析存在其他要求，可填写具体意见，大模型根据您的补充信息进行分析。","query_placeholder":"例如：风险分析报告需包含报告摘要、已逾期风险分析、逾期预测分析、综合风险评估及风险概况及风险规避建议。","subtitle":"","subtitle_api":"/HFB/common/dmx_risk/management=metrics_query.service","subtitle_api_method":"post","subtitle_api_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"{\\n  \\\"titleKey\\\": \\\"fxgl_dhhkfx_title\\\"\\n}\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n}","query":"","key":"https://appcs.jbysoft.com/gjjrgzn/system/config?sjc_1767422903684=0&","footer_text":""}');
INSERT INTO sys_page_template VALUES(713,'dhhkfx','贷款逾期预测',unistr('\u000a\u000a{\u000a    "type": "page",\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    "id": "global_page_root",     \u000a    "className": "p-none",\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    "data": {\u000a        "show_analysis_result": false,  \u000a        "ai_loading": false             \u000a    },\u000a\u000a    "body": [\u000a        \u000a        \u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a{\u000a    "type": "container",\u000a    "className": "page-header-component",\u000a    "style": {\u000a        "backgroundColor": "",\u000a        "padding": "20px 20px", \u000a        "marginBottom": "20px",\u000a        "position": "relative"  \u000a    },\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    \u000a\u000a    "body": [\u000a        \u000a\u000a        \u000a        \u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "service",\u000a            "style": {\u000a                "width": "100%" \u000a            },\u000a            "api": {\u000a                "method": "post",\u000a                "url": "/HFB/common/dmx_risk/management=metrics_query.service",\u000a                "dataType": "json"\u000a                ,\u000a                "data": {\u000a  "cxlx": "{\\n  \\"titleKey\\": \\"fxgl_dhhkfx_title\\"\\n}",\u000a  "jgbh": "1305282025"\u000a}\u000a                \u000a                \u000a            },\u000a            "body": [\u000a                \u000a                \u000a                {\u000a                    "type": "container",\u000a                    "className": "text-center",\u000a                    "style": {\u000a                        "position": "static" \u000a                    },\u000a                    "body": [\u000a                        {\u000a                            "type": "tpl",\u000a                            "tpl": "<h2 style=''font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #262626; margin: 5px 0;''>贷款逾期预测</h2>"\u000a                        },\u000a                        {\u000a                            "type"