"type":"input-text","placeholder":"例如：生成贷款逾期分析图表"},{"name":"ai_generate_api","label":"AI生成页面API地址","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":"/api/ai/generate-page"},{"name":"workflow_type","label":"AI 工作流类型标识（默认：ai_analysis）","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":"ai_analysis"},{"name":"query","label":"AI分析查询参数","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":"{}"}]},{"type":"fieldSet","title":"⚙️ 其他配置","className":"m-t","collapsable":true,"collapsed":true,"body":[{"name":"footer_text","label":"底部文本 (自动推断)","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":"© 2025"},{"name":"default_items","label":"default items (自动推断)","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":""},{"name":"import_items","label":"import items (自动推断)","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":""},{"name":"desc","label":"desc (自动推断)","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":""},{"name":"template_url","label":"template url (自动推断)","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":""},{"name":"key","label":"key (自动推断)","required":false,"type":"input-text","placeholder":""}]}],"__debug":"adaptor executed","enable_report_button":true,"enable_data_import":"","enable_ai_analysis":true,"enable_query_input":true,"title":"线上服务满意度分析","subtitle_api":"/HFB/common/dmx_risk/management=metrics_query.service","subtitle_api_method":"post","subtitle_api_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"{\\n  \\\"titleKey\\\": \\\"fxgl_fwmydfx_title\\\"\\n}\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n}","report_workflow_type":"report_generation","query":"{1:1}","alert_html":"<div style=''margin-bottom: 12px;''> <div style=''background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; line-height: 1.7;''>  <div style=''color: #1d1d1f; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #1890ff;''> 定义与分类</div>  <div style=''margin-bottom: 20px;''> <div style=''color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;''>风险定义</div> <div style=''color: #333; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;''>投诉风险是指因公积金业务办理、服务质量、政策理解或系统故障等原因，导致缴存人或单位通过热线、信访、网络等渠道表达不满，可能引发舆情、影响公信力或造成法律纠纷的风险。 </div> <div style=''color: #333; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;''> 线上用户行为分析是指针对公积金官网、APP、公众号等线上服务渠道，收集用户浏览、搜索、业务办理、咨询反馈等行为数据，通过统计解读其行为特征、需求偏好及操作痛点，为优化线上服务流程、提升交互体验、解决系统问题提供数据支撑的分析工作。 </div> </div> <div style=''margin-bottom: 0;''> \t<div style=''color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;''>风险分类</div> <div style=''color: #333; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;''>\t公积金投诉包括对缴存、提取、贷款等业务办理流程及结果不满的业务类投诉，对窗口人员态度、热线响应速度、办事效率等不满的服务类投诉，对公积金政策合理性、公平性、透明度提出异议的政策类投诉，以及因线上服务平台、APP、自助终端故障导致业务受阻的系统类投诉。 \t</div> \t<div style=''color: #333; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;''>\t线上用户行为分析围绕公积金线上服务场景，按核心维度分类：按行为目的可分为信息获取类（政策浏览、资讯等）、业务办理类（缴存查询、提取申请、贷款申报等操作）；按业务场景可分为缴存相关、提取相关、贷款相关、综合查询类行为；通过分类统计各行为的频次及异常情况，精准挖掘用户需求与服务痛点，为线上服务优化提供数据支撑。 \t</div> \t</div> </div> </div> </div>","id":717,"page_key":"fwmydfx","version":9,"mode":"update","query_label":"若对大模型分析存在其他要求，可填写具体意见，大模型根据您的补充信息进行分析。","query_placeholder":"例如：生成服务满意度图表","key":"https://appcs.jbysoft.com/gjjrgzn/system/config?sjc_1767422885871=0&"}');
