px; padding: 3px 8px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11px;\"> \t\t\tAI \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"color: #1a202c; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;\"> \t\t\t归集扩面政策 \t\t</div> \t</div> \t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 14px;\"> \t\t<div style=\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\"> \t\t\t定义 \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"> \t\t\t归集增长率是指一定时期内住房公积金归集额的增长幅度，通常以月度、季度或年度为统计周期，计算公式为：（本期归集额-上期归集额）/上期归集额×100%。该指标反映了住房公积金资金池的增长活力和缴存业务发展态势，是衡量公积金制度运行效率和覆盖范围的重要量化指标，也是预测未来资金规模、制定资金管理策略的核心依据。 \t\t</div> \t</div> \t<div style=\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\"> \t\t影响政策 \t</div> \t<div style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;\"> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t1、缴存基数政策：设定缴存基数上下限，一般为当地上年度职工平均工资的60%-300%，基数调整机制每年执行一次； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t2、缴存比例政策：单位和职工缴存比例范围通常为5%-12%，由单位根据自身情况在规定范围内自主确定； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t3、缴存范围政策：所有机关、事业单位、企业、社会团体等组织及其在职职工均需缴存住房公积金，逐步推进灵活就业人员自愿缴存机制； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t4、补缴与缓缴政策：允许单位因特殊情况办理公积金补缴，困难企业可申请阶段性缓缴，缓缴期间职工正常提取和贷款不受影响； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t5、激励政策：对按时足额缴存的单位给予信用激励，对未按规定缴存的单位实施约谈提醒和行政处罚。 \t\t</div> \t</div> </div> </div>","columns":"5","policy_actions":"[\n  {\n    \"label\": \"历史数据\",\n    \"actionType\": \"dialog\",\n    \"level\": \"info\",\n    \"style\": {\n      \"marginLeft\": \"10px\"\n    },\n    \"dialog\": {\n      \"title\": \"历史数据清册\",\n      \"size\": \"xl\",\n      \"body\": {\n        \"type\": \"tabs\",\n        \"tabs\": [\n          {\n            \"title\": \"内部数据\",\n            \"body\": {\n              \"type\": \"crud\",\n              \"api\": {\n                \"method\": \"post\",\n                \"url\": \"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=detail_query.service\",\n                \"data\": {\n                  \"&\": \"$$\",\n                  \"cxlx\": {\n                    \"mxKey\": \"zcyc_gjzzl_lsmx\"\n                  },\n                  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"perPageField\": \"size\",\n              \"syncLocation\": false,\n              \"perPage\": 10,\n              \"perPageAvailable\": [\n                10,\n                20,\n                50,\n                100\n              ],\n              \"footerToolbar\": [\n                \"statistics\",\n                \"switch-per-page\",\n                \"pagination\"\n              ],\n              \"columns\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"value1\",\n                  \"label\": \"年月\",\n                  \"width\": 100\n                },\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"value2\",\n                  \"label\": \"归集额(万元)\",\n                  \"width\": 150\n                },\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"value3\",\n                  \"label\": \"缴存人数(人)\",\n                  \"width\": 150\n                },\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"value4\",\n                  \"label\": \"增长率(%)\",\n                  \"width\": 150\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"title\": \"外部数据\",\n            \"body\": {\n              \"type\": \"service\",\n              \"api\": {\n                \"method\": \"post\",\n                \"url\": \"/gjjrgzn/api/ai/get-history\",\n                \"data\": {\n                  \"&\": \"$$\",\n                  \"data_source\": \"external\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"body\": {\n                \"type\": \"container\",\n                \"body\": [\n                  {\n                    \"type\": \"button-toolbar\",\n                    \"className\": \"m-b-md\",\n                    \"buttons\": [\n                      {\n                        \"type\": \"button\",\n                        \"label\": \"📥 模板下载\",\n                        \"level\": \"default\",\n                        \"actionType\": \"download\",\n                        \"api\": {\n                          \"method\": \"get\",\n                          \"url\": \"/gjjrgzn/api/ai/download-template\"\n                        }\n                      },\n                      {\n                        \"type\": \"button\",\n                        \"label\": \"📤 导入\",\n                        \"level\": \"primary\",\n                        \"actionType\": \"dialog\",\n                        \"dialog\": {\n                          \"title\": \"导入外部数据\",\n                          \"size\": \"lg\",\n                          \"body\": {\n                            \"type\": \"form\",\n                            \"api\": {\n                              \"method\": \"post\",\n                              \"url\": \"/gjjrgzn/api/ai/import-external-data\",\n                              \"data\": {\n                                \"&\": \"$$\"\n                              }\n                            },\n                            \"body\": [\n                              {\n                                \"type\": \"input-excel\",\n                                \"name\": \"excel_data\",\n                                \"label\": \"上传Excel文件\",\n                                \"accept\": \".xlsx,.xls\",\n                                \"autoFill\": {\n                                  \"data_rows\": \"${items}\"\n                                },\n                                \"plainText\": false,\n                                \"parseMode\": \"array\"\n                              },\n                              {\n                                \"type\": \"static-json\",\n                                \"name\": \"data_rows\",\n                                \"label\": \"预览数据\",\n                                \"levelExpand\": 1\n                              },\n                              {\n                                \"type\": \"divider\"\n                              },\n                              {\n                                \"type\": \"alert\",\n                                \"level\": \"info\",\n                                \"body\": \"提示：上传后将自动解析Excel内容，请检查预览数据是否正确\"\n                              }\n                            ],\n                            \"actions\": [\n                              {\n                                \"type\": \"button\",\n                                \"label\": \"取消\",\n                                \"actionType\": \"cancel\"\n                              },\n                              {\n                                \"type\": \"submit\",\n                                \"label\": \"确认导入\",\n                                \"level\": \"primary\"\n                              }\n                            ]\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    ]\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"type\": \"crud\",\n                    \"api\": \"${items}\",\n                    \"syncLocation\": false,\n                    \"perPage\": 10,\n                    \"perPageAvailable\": [\n                      10,\n                      20,\n                      50,\n                      100\n                    ],\n                    \"footerToolbar\": [\n                      \"statistics\",\n                      \"pagination\"\n                    ],\n                    \"columns\": [\n                      {\n                        \"name\": \"year_month\",\n                        \"label\": \"年月\",\n                        \"width\": 100\n                      },\n                      {\n                        \"name\": \"pjgz\",\n                        \"label\": \"平均工资(元)\",\n                        \"width\": 150\n                      },\n                      {\n                        \"name\": \"xzczjyrs\",\n                        \"label\": \"新增城镇就业人数(人)\",\n                        \"width\": 150\n                      }\n                    ]\n                  }\n                ]\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"label\": \"AI预测\",\n    \"actionType\": \"ai_analysis\",\n    \"level\": \"danger\"\n  }\n]","api_method":"post","api_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"{\\n  \\\"metricsKey\\\": \\\"zcyc_gjzzl_value\\\"\\n}\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n}","api_url":"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service","policy_groups":"[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"缴存增长率参数\",\n    \"columns\": 3,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"heating_period\",\n        \"label\": \"预测周期\",\n        \"type\": \"select\",\n        \"source\": {\n          \"method\": \"post\",\n          \"url\": \"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=select_query.service\",\n          \"data\": {\n            \"cxlx\": {\n              \"metricsKey\": \"zcyc_gjzzl_newvalue\"\n            },\n            \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n          },\n          \"adaptor\": \"return { ...payload, options: payload.data.options }\"\n        },\n        \"autoFill\": {\n          \"extRate\": \"${value2}\",\n          \"extLabel\": \"${label}\"\n        },\n        \"initAutoFill\": true,\n        \"selectFirst\": true,\n        \"clearable\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"extRate\",\n        \"label\": \"${extLabel}(%)\",\n        \"type\": \"static\",\n        \"placeholder\": \"-\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"target_rate\",\n        \"label\": \"目标缴存增长率(%)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 1.5,\n        \"precision\": 1\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]","form_title":"调整目标缴存增长率参数","report_button_label":"生成分析报告","report_workflow_type":"report_generation","report_query":"{1:1}","enable_query_input":true,"footer_text":""}');
INSERT INTO sys_page_template VALUES(762,'dwkm','单位扩面',unistr('\u000a\u000a{\u000a    "type": "page",\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    "id": "global_page_root",     \u000a    "className": "p-none",\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    "data": {\u000a        "show_analysis_result": false,  \u000a        "ai_loading": false             \u000a    },\u000a\u000a    "body": [\u000a        \u000a        \u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a{\u000a    "type": "container",\u000a    "className": "page-header-component",\u000a    "style": {\u000a        "backgroundColor": "",\u000a        "padding": "20px 20px", \u000a        "marginBottom": "20px",\u000a        "position": "relative"  \u000a    },\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    \u000a\u000a    "body": [\u000a        \u000a\u000a        \u000a        \u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "container",\u000a            "className": "text-center",\u000a            "style": {\u000a                "width": "100%"\u000a            },\u000a            "body": [\u000a                {\u000a                    "type": "tpl",\u000a                    "tpl": "<h2 style=''font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #262626; margin: 5px 0;''>单位扩面</h2>"\u000a                },\u000a                {\u000a                    "type": "tpl",\u000a                    "tpl": "<div style=''color: #8c8c8c; font-size: 13px;''></div>"\u000a                }\u000a            ]\u000a        }\u000a        \u000a        ,\u000a        \u000a    {\u000a        "type": "button",\u000a        "label": "生成风险分析报告",\u000a        "level": "danger",\u000a        "style": {\u000a            "position": "absolute",        \u000a            "right": "20px",               \u000a            "top": "50%",                  \u000a            "transform": "translateY(-50%)", \u000a            "zIndex": "10"\u000a        },\u000a        "onEvent": {\u000a            "click": {\u000a                "actions": [\u000a                    \u000a                    \u000a                    {\u000a                        "actionType": "setValue",\u000a                        "componentId": "global_page_root",\u000a                        "args": {\u000a                            "value": {\u000a                                "show_report_result": true,\u000a                                "report_loading": true\u000a                            }\u000a                        }\u000a                    }\u000a                ]\u000a            }\u000a        }\u000a    }\u000a    \u000a        \u000a        \u000a        \u000a    ]\u000a}\u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a,{\u000a    "type": "service",\u000a    "id": "report_display_root",\u000a    "className": "p-none",\u000a    "body": [\u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "tpl",\u000a            "tpl": "<style>.report-content-area { max-height: calc(80vh - 120px) !important; overflow-y: auto !important; } .report-content-area > * { max-height: 100%; }</style>"\u000a        },\u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "container",\u000a            "visibleOn": "${report_loading}",\u000a            "style": {\u000a                "position": "fixed",\u000a                "top": "0",\u000a                "left": "0",\u000a                "width": "100vw",\u000a                "height": "100vh",\u000a                "backgroundColor": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9)",\u000a                "zIndex": "10000",\u000a                "display": "flex",\u000a                "alignItems": "center",\u000a                "justifyContent": "center",\u000a                "backdropFilter": "blur(8px)"\u000a            },\u000a            "body": [{\u000a                "type": "custom",\u000a                "name": "report-timer",\u000a                "html": "<div style=''font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, Arial; color: #333;''><div style=''position: relative; width: 80px; height: 80px; margin: 0 auto 24px auto;''><svg viewBox=''0 0 50 50'' style=''width: 100%; height: 100%; animation: spin 2s linear infinite;''><circle cx=''25'' cy=''25'' r=''20'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#e6f7ff'' stroke-width=''4''></circle><circle cx=''25'' cy=''25'' r=''20'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#1890ff'' stroke-width=''4'' stroke-dasharray=''80'' stroke-dashoffset=''60'' stroke-linecap=''round''></circle></svg><div style=''position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1890ff;''><span id=''report-timer-sec''>0</span><span style=''font-size: 12px; margin-left: 2px; font-weight: 400;''>s</span></div></div><div style=''font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #333; margin-bottom: 12px;''>正在生成报告</div><div id=''report-timer-text'' style=''font-size: 14px; color: #666;''>正在准备数据...</div><style>@keyframes spin { 0% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }</style></div>",\u000a                "onMount": "const startTime = Date.now(); const secDom = document.getElementById(''report-timer-sec''); const textDom = document.getElementById(''report-timer-text''); const texts = [''正在准备数据...'', ''正在调用AI分析...'', ''正在生成报告...'', ''即将完成...'']; window.reportTimer = setInterval(() => { const elapsed = ((Date.now() - startTime) / 1000).toFixed(1); if(secDom) secDom.innerText = elapsed; const step = Math.floor(elapsed / 3) % texts.length; if(textDom) textDom.innerText = texts[step]; }, 100);",\u000a                "onUnmount": "clearInterval(window.reportTimer);"\u000a            }]\u000a        },\u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "container",\u000a            "visibleOn": "${show_report_result}",\u000a            "style": {\u000a                "position": "fixed",\u000a                "top": "0",\u000a                "left": "0",\u000a                "width": "100vw",\u000a                "height": "100vh",\u000a                "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)",\u000a                "zIndex": "9998",\u000a                "display": "flex",\u000a                "alignItems": "flex-start",\u000a                "justifyContent": "center",\u000a                "paddingTop": "20px",\u000a                "paddingBottom": "20px"\u000a            },\u000a            "body": [{\u000a                "type": "container",\u000a                "id": "report_dialog_box",\u000a                "style": {\u000a                    "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",\u000a                    "borderRadius": "8px",\u000a                    "width": "95%",\u000a                    "maxWidth": "1400px",\u000a                    "height": "80vh",\u000a                    "display": "flex",\u000a                    "flexDirection": "column",\u000a                    "boxShadow": "0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)",\u000a                    "position": "relative",\u000a                    "overflow": "hidden"\u000a                },\u000a                "body": [\u000a                    \u000a                    {\u000a                        "type": "button",\u000a                        "label": "✕",\u000a                        "level": "link",\u000a                        "style": {\u000a                            "position": "absolute",\u000a                            "top": "12px",\u000a                            "right": "16px",\u000a                            "color": "white",\u000a                            "fontSize": "20px",\u000a                            "padding": "0",\u000a                            "width": "28px",\u000a                            "height": "28px",\u000a                            "minWidth": "28px",\u000a                            "zIndex": "10",\u000a                            "lineHeight": "28px",\u000a                            "textAlign": "center"\u000a                        },\u000a                        "onEvent": {\u000a                            "click": {\u000a                                "actions": [{\u000a                                    "actionType": "setValue",\u000a                                    "componentId": "global_page_root",\u000a                                    "args": {\u000a                                        "value": {\u000a                                            "show_report_result": false,\u000a                                            "report_loading": false\u000a                                        }\u000a                                    }\u000a                                }]\u000a                            }\u000a                        }\u000a                    },\u000a                    \u000a                    {\u000a                        "type": "custom",\u000a                        "html": "<div id=''report-drag-header'' style=''background-color: #1a3c6e; color: white; padding: 14px 50px 14px 24px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; cursor: move; user-select: none;''><span style=''font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;''>📄 风险分析报告预览</span></div>",\u000a                        "onMount": "var header = document.getElementById(''report-drag-header''); var dialog = header.closest(''[data-component-id=\\"report_dialog_box\\"]'') || header.parentElement.parentElement; var isDragging = false; var offsetX = 0; var offsetY = 0; header.onmousedown = function(e) { isDragging = true; offsetX = e.clientX - dialog.offsetLeft; offsetY = e.clientY - dialog.offsetTop; dialog.style.position = ''fixed''; dialog.style.margin = ''0''; }; document.onmousemove = function(e) { if (isDragging) { dialog.style.left = (e.clientX - offsetX) + ''px''; dialog.style.top = (e.clientY - offsetY) + ''px''; } }; document.onmouseup = function() { isDragging = false; };",\u000a                        "onUnmount": "document.onmousemove = null; document.onmouseup = null;"\u000a                    },\u000a                    \u000a                    {\u000a                        "type": "service",\u000a                        "id": "report_service_inner",\u000a                        "className": "report-content-area",\u000a                        "style": {\u000a                            "flex": "1 1 0",\u000a                            "minHeight": "0",\u000a                            "overflowY": "auto",\u000a                            "padding": "24px",\u000a                            "backgroundColor": "#ffffff"\u000a                        },\u000a                        "schemaApi": {\u000a                            "method": "post",\u000a                            "url": "/api/ai/generate-page",\u000a                            "sendOn": "${report_loading === true}",\u000a                            "data": {\u000a                                "pageId": "dwkm",\u000a                                "workflow_type": "report_generation",\u000a                                "query": "生成 dwkm 分析报告",\u000a                                "timestamp": "${date(now(), ''x'')}"\u000a                                \u000a                            }\u000a                        },\u000a                        "onEvent": {\u000a                            "fetchSchemaInited": {\u000a                                "actions": [{\u000a                                    "actionType": "setValue",\u000a                                    "componentId": "global_page_root",\u000a                                    "args": {\u000a                                        "value": {\u000a                                            "report_loading": false\u000a                                        }\u000a                                    }\u000a                                }]\u000a                            },\u000a                            "fetchFailed": {\u000a                                "actions": [{\u000a                                    "actionType": "setValue",\u000a                                    "componentId": "global_page_root",\u000a                                    "args": {\u000a                                        "value":