nagement=gjznkm_dr.service","template_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"lhbdcxx_mbxz\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\",\n  \"value1\": \"不动产数据模板\"\n}","desc":"支持格式: .xlsx","accept":".xlsx","template_url":"/HFB/common/dmx/management=gjznkm_mbxz.service","title":"不动产数据"}],"key":"https://appcs.jbysoft.com/gjjrgzn/system/config?","title":"灵活缴存扩面","page_key":"lhjckm","id":814,"version":1,"mode":"create","footer_text":"","alert_html":"<div style=''margin-bottom: 12px;''> <div style=''background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; line-height: 1.7;''> <div style=''color: #1d1d1f; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #1890ff;''> 定义与分类</div> <div style=''margin-bottom: 20px;''><div style=''color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;''>定义</div><div style=''color: #333; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;''>灵活缴存职工扩面，是指住房公积金管理部门通过社保、婚姻、不动产数据的交叉比对与综合分析，精准识别出未缴纳住房公积金的灵活就业人员，为其提供差异化、针对性的缴存政策指导与服务支持，从而吸纳该群体纳入公积金制度覆盖范围，保障灵活就业人员住房消费与资金储备权益的专项工作。</div></div><div style=''margin-bottom: 0;''><div style=''color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;''>分类</div><div style=''padding-left: 0; margin-top: 10px;''><div style=''color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;''>高潜力群体：高潜力群体有稳定社保缴费记录，叠加不动产交易、婚姻住房需求等数据，缴存意愿和能力双高</div><div style=''color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;''>中潜力群体：中潜力群体社保缴费断续，有潜在购房刚需但暂未落实行动，具备一定储蓄规划基础，需政策激励激活缴存意愿。</div></div></div></div></div>","import_dialog_title":"","query_label":"若对大模型分析存在其他要求，可填写具体意见，大模型根据您的补充信息进行分析。","query_placeholder":""}');
