le=\"margin-bottom: 14px;\"> \t\t<div style=\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\"> \t\t\t总则 \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"> \t\t\t为规范住房公积金贷款管理，优化贷款政策，提高资金使用效率，支持缴存职工合理住房需求，依据《住房公积金管理条例》及相关规定，制定本贷前政策分析体系。 \t\t</div> \t</div> \t<!-- 细则 --> \t<div> \t\t<div style=\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\"> \t\t\t细则 \t\t</div> \t\t<div class=\"policy-details\" style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"> \t\t\t<div style=\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\"> \t\t\t\t一、贷款申请资格 \t\t\t</div> \t\t\t<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\"> \t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t1、连续缴存住房公积金满6个月方可申请贷款； \t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t2、首套房首付款不低于房屋总价的20%，二套房不低于房屋总价的30%； \t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t</ul> \t\t\t<div style=\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\"> \t\t\t\t二、贷款年限 \t\t\t</div> \t\t\t<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\"> \t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t1、贷款年限最高30年； \t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t2、贷款年限不超过借款人退休年龄，最长可延长5年； \t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t3、二手房房龄加贷款年限不超过50年； \t\t\t\t\t\t</li> \t\t\t</ul> \t\t\t<div style=\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\"> \t\t\t\t三、贷款额度 \t\t\t</div> \t\t\t<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\"> \t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t1、贷款额度：单人30万元，双人及以上60万元； \t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t2、月还款额不超过家庭月收入的50%； \t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t3、最高可贷额度不高于账户余额的15倍； \t\t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t</ul> \t\t\t<div style=\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\"> \t\t\t\t四、特殊政策额度上浮调整（符合多种情形的按最高限额执行，不可叠加） \t\t\t</div> \t\t\t<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\"> \t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t1、享受人才安居政策额度上浮20%； \t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t2、二孩及以上家庭成员额度上浮20%。 \t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t</ul> \t\t</div> \t</div> </div>","columns":"4","api_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"{\\n  \\\"metricsKey\\\": \\\"zcyc_gjjdqzc_value\\\"\\n}\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n}","api_method":"post","api_url":"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service","form_title":"调整政策参数","footer_text":"","enable_query_input":true,"policy_groups":"[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"贷款申请资格\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_lxjcys\",\n        \"label\": \"连续缴存月数（月）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_stsfbl\",\n        \"label\": \"首套房首付比例（%）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 20,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_etsfbl\",\n        \"label\": \"二套房首付比例（%）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 30,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"贷款年限\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_zgdknx\",\n        \"label\": \"最高贷款年限（年）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 30,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_txhycnx\",\n        \"label\": \"退休后可延长年限（年）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_erffl\",\n        \"label\": \"二手房房龄+贷款年限上限（年）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 50,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"贷款额度\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_drdked\",\n        \"label\": \"单人贷款额度上限（万元）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 30,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_srdked\",\n        \"label\": \"双人及以上贷款额度上限（万元）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 60,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_yhkesrb\",\n        \"label\": \"月还款额不超过家庭月收入(%)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 50,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_zhyebs\",\n        \"label\": \"账户余额倍数\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 15,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"特殊政策额度上浮调整\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_rcajzcsf\",\n        \"label\": \"人才安居政策上浮（%）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 20,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_erjtzcsf\",\n        \"label\": \"二孩家庭政策上浮（%）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 20,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]","id":645,"version":21,"mode":"update","policy_actions":"[\n  {\n    \"label\": \"AI预测\",\n    \"actionType\": \"ai_analysis\",\n    \"level\": \"danger\"\n  }\n]"}');
