房首付款不低于房屋总价的20%，二套房不低于房屋总价的30%； \\t\\t</div> \\t\\t<div style=\\"margin-bottom: 4px;\\"> \\t\\t\\t4、连续缴存住房公积金满6个月方可申请贷款； \\t\\t</div> \\t\\t<div style=\\"margin-bottom: 4px;\\"> \\t\\t\\t5、二手房房龄加贷款年限不超过50年； \\t\\t</div> \\t\\t<div style=\\"margin-bottom: 4px;\\"> \\t\\t\\t6、贷款年限不超过借款人退休年龄，最长可延长5年； \\t\\t</div>\\t\\t \\t\\t<div style=\\"margin-bottom: 4px;\\"> \\t\\t\\t7、享受人才安居政策额度上浮20%； \\t\\t</div>\\t\\t \\t\\t<div style=\\"margin-bottom: 4px;\\"> \\t\\t\\t8、二孩及以上家庭成员额度上浮20%。 \\t\\t</div>\\t\\t \\t</div> </div> </div></div>"\u000a}\u000a,\u000a\u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "container",\u000a            "className": "m-t-md",\u000a            "style": {\u000a                "backgroundColor": "#fff",\u000a                "borderRadius": "10px",\u000a                "boxShadow": "0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)",\u000a                "padding": "25px",\u000a                "marginBottom": "20px"\u000a            },\u000a            "body": [\u000a                \u000a                \u000a    {\u000a      "type": "service",\u000a      \u000a      "api": {\u000a        "method": "post",\u000a        "url": "/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service"\u000a        \u000a        ,"data": {"cxlx":"{\\n  \\"metricsKey\\": \\"zcyc_zxgdl_value\\"\\n}","jgbh":"1305282025"}\u000a        \u000a        \u000a      },\u000a      \u000a      "body": [\u000a        \u000a        \u000a\u000a        \u000a        \u000a        \u000a        {\u000a          "type": "each",\u000a          "name": "${groups || [{ items: [], title: '''', columns: 5, border_color: '''' }]}",\u000a          "items": {\u000a            "type": "container",\u000a            "className": "m-b-md",\u000a            "body": [\u000a              {\u000a                "type": "html",\u000a                "tpl": "<div style=''font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #1a3c6e; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;''>${title}</div>",\u000a        