00%。该指标是衡量住房公积金资金使用效率和风险水平的核心指标，反映公积金中心的资金流动性状况和贷款发放能力。个贷率过高可能导致资金流动性紧张，影响正常提取和贷款发放；个贷率过低则表明资金使用效率不高，未能充分发挥公积金制度的住房保障作用。 \t\t</div> \t</div> \t<div style=\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\"> \t\t影响政策 \t</div> \t<div style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;\"> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t1、单缴存职工最高贷款额度30万元、双职工家庭最高额度60万元； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t2、最高可贷额度不高于账户余额的15倍； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t3、首套房首付款不低于房屋总价的20%，二套房不低于房屋总价的30%； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t4、连续缴存住房公积金满6个月方可申请贷款； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t5、二手房房龄加贷款年限不超过50年； \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t6、贷款年限不超过借款人退休年龄，最长可延长5年； \t\t</div>\t\t \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t7、享受人才安居政策额度上浮20%； \t\t</div>\t\t \t\t<div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"> \t\t\t8、二孩及以上家庭成员额度上浮20%。 \t\t</div>\t\t \t</div> </div> </div>","columns":"5","api_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"{\\n  \\\"metricsKey\\\": \\\"zcyc_zxgdl_value\\\"\\n}\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n}","api_method":"post","api_url":"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service","form_title":"设置目标与达成时间","policy_groups":"[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"中心个贷率参数\",\n    \"columns\": 3,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"zxgdl_dqgdl\",\n        \"label\": \"当前个贷率(%)\",\n        \"type\": \"select\",\n        \"source\": {\n          \"method\": \"post\",\n          \"url\": \"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=static_query.service\",\n          \"data\": {\n            \"cxlx\": {\n              \"metricsKey\": \"zcyc_zxgdl_newvalue\"\n            },\n            \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n          },\n          \"adaptor\": \"return { ...payload, options: payload.data.options }\"\n        },\n        \"selectFirst\": true,\n        \"static\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"zxgdl_mbgdl\",\n        \"label\": \"目标个贷率(%)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 80,\n        \"precision\": 2\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"zxgdl_dcsj\",\n        \"label\": \"达成时间(月)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 12,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]","footer_text":"","enable_query_input":true,"id":439,"version":42,"mode":"update","policy_actions":"[\n  {\n    \"label\": \"历史数据\",\n    \"actionType\": \"dialog\",\n    \"level\": \"info\",\n    \"style\": {\n      \"marginLeft\": \"10px\"\n    },\n    \"dialog\": {\n      \"title\": \"历史数据清册\",\n      \"size\": \"xl\",\n      \"body\": {\n        \"type\": \"tabs\",\n        \"tabs\": [\n          {\n            \"title\": \"内部数据\",\n            \"body\": {\n              \"type\": \"crud\",\n              \"api\": {\n                \"method\": \"post\",\n                \"url\": \"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=detail_query.service\",\n                \"data\": {\n                  \"&\": \"$$\",\n                  \"cxlx\": {\n                    \"mxKey\": \"zcyc_zxgdl_lsmx\"\n                  },\n                  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"perPageField\": \"size\",\n              \"syncLocation\": false,\n              \"perPage\": 10,\n              \"perPageAvailable\": [\n                10,\n                20,\n                50,\n                100\n              ],\n              \"footerToolbar\": [\n                \"statistics\",\n                \"switch-per-page\",\n                \"pagination\"\n              ],\n              \"columns\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"value1\",\n                  \"label\": \"年月\",\n                  \"width\": 100\n                },\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"value2\",\n                  \"label\": \"月末归集余额(万元)\",\n                  \"width\": 150\n                },\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"value3\