color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\"> \t\t\t总则 \t\t</div> \t\t<div style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"> \t\t\t为规范住房公积金贷款管理，优化贷款政策，提高资金使用效率，支持缴存职工合理住房需求，依据《住房公积金管理条例》及相关规定，制定本贷前政策分析体系。 \t\t</div> \t</div> \t<!-- 细则 --> \t<div> \t\t<div style=\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\"> \t\t\t细则 \t\t</div> \t\t<div class=\"policy-details\" style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"> \t\t\t<div style=\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\"> \t\t\t\t一、贷款申请资格 \t\t\t</div> \t\t\t<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\"> \t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t1、连续缴存住房公积金满6个月方可申请贷款； \t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t2、首套房首付款不低于房屋总价的20%，二套房不低于房屋总价的30%； \t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t</ul> \t\t\t<div style=\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\"> \t\t\t\t二、贷款年限 \t\t\t</div> \t\t\t<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\"> \t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t1、贷款年限最高30年； \t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t2、贷款年限不超过借款人退休年龄，最长可延长5年； \t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t3、二手房房龄加贷款年限不超过50年； \t\t\t\t\t\t</li> \t\t\t</ul> \t\t\t<div style=\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\"> \t\t\t\t三、贷款额度 \t\t\t</div> \t\t\t<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\"> \t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t1、贷款额度：单人30万元，双人及以上60万元； \t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t2、月还款额不超过家庭月收入的50%； \t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t3、最高可贷额度不高于账户余额的15倍； \t\t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t</ul> \t\t\t<div style=\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\"> \t\t\t\t四、特殊政策额度上浮调整（符合多种情形的按最高限额执行，不可叠加） \t\t\t</div> \t\t\t<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\"> \t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t1、享受人才安居政策额度上浮20%； \t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t\t\t<li> \t\t\t\t\t\t2、二孩及以上家庭成员额度上浮20%。 \t\t\t\t\t\t</i> \t\t\t</ul> \t\t</div> \t</div> </div>","columns":"4","api_data":"{\n  \"cxlx\": \"{\\n  \\\"metricsKey\\\": \\\"zcyc_gjjdqzc_value\\\"\\n}\",\n  \"jgbh\": \"1305282025\"\n}","api_method":"post","api_url":"/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=metrics_query.service","form_title":"调整政策参数","footer_text":"","enable_query_input":true,"policy_groups":"[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"贷款申请资格\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_lxjcys\",\n        \"label\": \"连续缴存月数（月）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_stsfbl\",\n        \"label\": \"首套房首付比例（%）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 20,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_etsfbl\",\n        \"label\": \"二套房首付比例（%）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 30,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"贷款年限\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_zgdknx\",\n        \"label\": \"最高贷款年限（年）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 30,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_txhycnx\",\n        \"label\": \"退休后可延长年限（年）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_erffl\",\n        \"label\": \"二手房房龄+贷款年限上限（年）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 50,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"贷款额度\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_drdked\",\n        \"label\": \"单人贷款额度上限（万元）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 30,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_srdked\",\n        \"label\": \"双人及以上贷款额度上限（万元）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 60,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_yhkesrb\",\n        \"label\": \"月还款额不超过家庭月收入(%)\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 50,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_zhyebs\",\n        \"label\": \"账户余额倍数\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 15,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"特殊政策额度上浮调整\",\n    \"columns\": 4,\n    \"fields\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_rcajzcsf\",\n        \"label\": \"人才安居政策上浮（%）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 20,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"dqzc_erjtzcsf\",\n        \"label\": \"二孩家庭政策上浮（%）\",\n        \"type\": \"input-number\",\n        \"value\": 20,\n        \"precision\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]","id":645,"version":21,"mode":"update","policy_actions":"[\n  {\n    \"label\": \"AI预测\",\n    \"actionType\": \"ai_analysis\",\n    \"level\": \"danger\"\n  }\n]"}');
INSERT INTO sys_page_template VALUES(850,'gjjdhzc','贷后政策调整预测',unistr('\u000a\u000a\u000a{\u000a    "type": "page",\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    "id": "global_page_root",     \u000a    "className": "p-none",\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    "data": {\u000a        "show_analysis_result": false,  \u000a        "ai_loading": false,            \u000a        "show_prediction": false        \u000a    },\u000a\u000a    "body": [\u000a        \u000a        \u000a\u000a\u000a\u000a{\u000a    "type": "container",\u000a    "className": "page-header-component",\u000a    "style": {\u000a        "backgroundColor": "",\u000a        "padding": "20px 20px", \u000a        "marginBottom": "20px",\u000a        "position": "relative"  \u000a    },\u000a    \u000a    \u000a    \u000a\u000a    "body": [\u000a        \u000a\u000a        \u000a        \u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "service",\u000a            "style": {\u000a                "width": "100%" \u000a            },\u000a            "api": {\u000a                "method": "post",\u000a                "url": "/HFB/common/dmx_policy/management=title_query.service",\u000a                "dataType": "json"\u000a                ,\u000a                "data": {\u000a  "cxlx": "{\\n  \\"titleKey\\": \\"zcyc_gjjdhzc_title\\"\\n}",\u000a  "jgbh": "1305282025"\u000a}\u000a                \u000a                \u000a            },\u000a            "body": [\u000a                \u000a                \u000a                {\u000a                    "type": "container",\u000a                    "className": "text-center",\u000a                    "style": {\u000a                        "position": "static" \u000a                    },\u000a                    "body": [\u000a                        {\u000a                            "type": "tpl",\u000a                            "tpl": "<h2 style=''font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #262626; margin: 5px 0;''>贷后政策调整预测</h2>"\u000a                        },\u000a                        {\u000a                            "type": "tpl",\u000a                            "tpl": "<div style=''color: #8c8c8c; font-size: 13px;''>${displayText}</div>"\u000a                        }\u000a                    ]\u000a                }\u000a                \u000a            ]\u000a        }\u000a        \u000a        \u000a        \u000a    ]\u000a}\u000a\u000a\u000a,\u000a\u000a        \u000a        \u000a\u000a{\u000a    "type": "tpl",\u000a    "tpl": "<div style=''margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e6f7ff; border: 1px solid #91d5ff; color: #1890ff;''><div style=\\"margin: -13px -17px; background: white; padding: 16px 20px; border: 1px solid #e8e8e8;\\"> \\t<!-- 标题行 --> \\t<div style=\\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px;\\"> \\t\\t<div style=\\"background: #3b82f6; color: white; border-radius: 3px; padding: 3px 8px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11px;\\"> \\t\\t\\tAI \\t\\t</div> \\t\\t<div style=\\"color: #1a202c; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;\\"> \\t\\t\\t贷后政策 \\t\\t</div> \\t</div> \\t<!-- 定义 --> \\t<div style=\\"margin-bottom: 14px;\\"> \\t\\t<div style=\\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\\"> \\t\\t\\t总则 \\t\\t</div> \\t\\t<div style=\\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\\"> \\t\\t\\t为规范住房公积金贷款还款管理，优化贷后政策，提高资金回收效率，保障资金安全，依据《住房公积金管理条例》及相关规定，制定本贷后政策分析体系。 \\t\\t</div> \\t</div> \\t<!-- 细则 --> \\t<div> \\t\\t<div style=\\"color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;\\"> \\t\\t\\t细则 \\t\\t</div> \\t\\t<div class=\\"policy-details\\" style=\\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\\"> \\t\\t\\t<div style=\\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\\"> \\t\\t\\t\\t一、提前还款 \\t\\t\\t</div> \\t\\t\\t<ul style=\\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\\"> \\t\\t\\t\\t<li> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1、提前还款需正常还贷满6个月且申请时贷款未逾期； \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</i> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t2、提前还本业务需间隔12个月； \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</i> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t3、提前还款金额单次不得少于1万元； \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</i> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t4、提取住房公积金提前偿还部分贷款本金，还贷额应不得低于2.5万元； \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</i> \\t\\t\\t</ul> \\t\\t\\t<div style=\\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\\"> \\t\\t\\t\\t二、逾期贷款 \\t\\t\\t</div> \\t\\t\\t<ul style=\\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\\"> \\t\\t\\t\\t<li> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1、转逾期宽限期3天； \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</i> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t2、免收罚息天数10天； \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</i> \\t\\t\\t</ul> \\t\\t\\t<div style=\\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\\"> \\t\\t\\t\\t三、期限变更 \\t\\t\\t</div> \\t\\t\\t<ul style=\\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\\"> \\t\\t\\t\\t<li> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1、期限变更后，月还款额不超过家庭月收入的50%； \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</i> \\t\\t\\t</ul> \\t\\t\\t<div style=\\"font-size: 13px;font-weight: bold;color: #1a3c6e;margin: 15px 0 8px 0;padding-bottom: 5px;border-bottom: 2px solid #e3f2fd;\\"> \\t\\t\\t\\t四、签约对冲还贷 \\t\\t\\t</div> \\t\\t\\t<ul style=\\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;line-height: 1.8;\\"> \\t\\t\\t\\t<li> \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1、账户余额需大于6个月的月还款额。 \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</i> \\t\\t\\t</ul> \\t\\t</div> \\t</div> </div></div>"\u000a}\u000a,\u000a\u000a        \u000a        {\u000a            "type": "container",\u000a            "className": "m-t-md",\u000a            "style": {\u000a                "backgroundColor": "#fff",\u000a                "borderRadius": "10px",\u000a                "boxShadow": "0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)",\u000a                "padding": "25px",\u000a                "marginBottom": "20px"\u000a            },\u000a            "body": [\u000a                \u000